WEBVTT

01:49.460 --> 01:54.920
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.020 --> 01:57.990
[Episode 40]

01:58.410 --> 02:01.510
[Nanyuan Road, South City]

02:27.560 --> 02:28.250
It's lit!

02:28.280 --> 02:29.650
It's lit! It's lit!

02:29.860 --> 02:31.310
T-Then hurry up and toss it out!

02:31.310 --> 02:31.970
Toss it out!

03:22.360 --> 03:23.410
Yan?

03:23.710 --> 03:25.000
Why are you here?

03:25.079 --> 03:26.910
Your Majesty and His Highness
are in trouble.

03:26.910 --> 03:27.770
If I don't come,

03:27.840 --> 03:29.180
how can I have peace of mind?

03:29.180 --> 03:30.310
Impressive.

03:31.190 --> 03:33.250
Although I'm not the Minister of War,

03:33.470 --> 03:35.430
I've at least read The Art of War.

03:35.430 --> 03:37.020
So what's this move called?

03:40.240 --> 03:41.170
Close the gates,

03:41.400 --> 03:42.600
and release the dogs!

03:46.240 --> 03:46.840
Let's go!

03:56.100 --> 04:00.360
Is there a move called "Close the gates
and release the dogs" in The Art of War?

04:02.360 --> 04:03.150
Isn't there?

04:04.440 --> 04:07.440
[Nanyu Lane, South City]

04:25.550 --> 04:26.430
[Hongyun Inn]

04:27.750 --> 04:28.630
Don't linger in the battle!

04:28.630 --> 04:29.430
Run!

04:46.440 --> 04:47.070
Shanhu.

04:47.070 --> 04:48.200
They're on our side.

04:48.670 --> 04:49.760
It's the Axe Gang?

04:50.270 --> 04:51.670
Why did you come to help us?

04:51.670 --> 04:53.620
You want those gold ingots and
luminous pearls again?

04:53.620 --> 04:54.750
Want those, my foot!

04:54.830 --> 04:57.060
Li Shiliu admitted that I'm more handsome
than him,

04:57.060 --> 04:58.640
so I'm lending a hand today for free.

04:58.640 --> 04:59.840
He wouldn't admit it,

04:59.970 --> 05:01.250
but I will.

05:29.390 --> 05:31.320
Who's putting on an act over there?

05:34.420 --> 05:37.020
The one who's come
to take your life, of course.

05:38.690 --> 05:39.630
General.

05:39.650 --> 05:40.580
Shall we attack?

05:41.510 --> 05:43.430
He's clearly provoking us.

05:44.159 --> 05:45.360
There must be traps

05:45.490 --> 05:46.730
on this path.

05:46.750 --> 05:47.810
Don't act rashly.

05:50.310 --> 05:51.409
Let's go that way.

05:57.260 --> 05:59.650
[Nansheng Street, South City]

06:28.590 --> 06:29.000
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

06:29.300 --> 06:30.190
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

06:30.580 --> 06:30.910
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

06:31.160 --> 06:32.260
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

06:32.560 --> 06:32.920
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

06:33.150 --> 06:34.130
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

06:34.540 --> 06:34.950
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

06:35.140 --> 06:36.180
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

06:37.130 --> 06:42.730
♪ Ahhh ♪

06:42.270 --> 06:43.290
Beat them to death!

06:43.290 --> 06:44.000
Hurry up!

06:44.780 --> 06:45.050
♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪

06:45.250 --> 06:46.300
♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪

06:46.360 --> 06:47.290
I'll kill you!

06:46.710 --> 06:47.110
♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪

06:47.290 --> 06:48.310
♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪

06:47.360 --> 06:48.650
Bastard! I'll kill you!

06:48.650 --> 06:49.040
♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪

06:48.940 --> 06:49.760
Hit here!

06:49.200 --> 06:50.230
♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪

06:49.920 --> 06:51.630
Have a taste of this itching powder!

06:50.710 --> 06:51.030
♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪

06:51.300 --> 06:52.180
♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪

06:54.360 --> 06:55.560
What are you doing here?

06:55.560 --> 06:57.040
We're not here to help you.

07:00.980 --> 07:07.920
♪ Ahhh ♪

07:04.160 --> 07:04.750
Come on.

07:04.750 --> 07:05.480
Give it to me.

07:08.420 --> 07:08.780
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

07:09.060 --> 07:10.040
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

07:10.490 --> 07:10.850
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

07:11.010 --> 07:12.170
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

07:12.410 --> 07:12.860
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

07:12.980 --> 07:14.120
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

07:14.370 --> 07:14.770
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

07:14.940 --> 07:16.480
♪ Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up ♪

07:16.610 --> 07:22.460
[20:59]

07:22.510 --> 07:24.850
[21:00]

07:23.720 --> 07:24.510
Let's go!

07:42.350 --> 07:43.530
[Imperial Edict]

07:44.270 --> 07:46.270
Chu Guihong, the traitor,
imprisoned His Majesty

07:46.270 --> 07:50.200
and plotted a rebellion, a crime
beyond pardon and deserving of death.

08:29.400 --> 08:33.260
[Somewhere Near Anhe Pier]

08:47.480 --> 08:48.270
Nan Heng.

08:49.410 --> 08:50.240
Today is

08:51.030 --> 08:52.630
the day you die.

08:53.550 --> 08:55.120
Don't speak too soon.

08:56.420 --> 08:58.890
The Qianyu reinforcements
will be here any moment.

08:58.890 --> 09:01.240
With only your little bunch
of Nightwalkers,

09:01.240 --> 09:02.770
you think you can take me on?

09:05.120 --> 09:06.650
I'm afraid Your Qianyu Army

09:07.200 --> 09:08.400
won't be able to come.

09:15.270 --> 09:16.290
Chief.

09:16.480 --> 09:17.670
We've wiped out

09:17.670 --> 09:19.360
the Qianyu rebel forces along the way.

09:19.360 --> 09:20.840
Once Chancellor Gao's army arrives,

09:20.840 --> 09:23.640
Chu Guihong will be on his knees
begging for mercy.

09:24.920 --> 09:25.930
Is that so?

09:37.000 --> 09:38.200
The headcount's off.

09:38.670 --> 09:40.360
Chu Guihong mobilized 5,000 soldiers,

09:40.360 --> 09:42.420
but there are only so few people here.

09:43.360 --> 09:44.160
Could it be...

09:45.080 --> 09:48.030
Could it be they set up an ambush
outside the city in advance?

09:48.030 --> 09:49.440
You laid an ambush here,

09:49.440 --> 09:52.480
but how do you know our Junior General
wouldn't ambush outside the city?

09:52.480 --> 09:53.910
Nan Heng's reinforcements

09:53.910 --> 09:54.970
won't make it here.

10:00.000 --> 10:01.120
Ten li outside the city,

10:01.120 --> 10:02.310
at Yangui Gorge,

10:02.480 --> 10:04.630
Chancellor Gao's private troops
have been drugged with knockout powder.

10:04.630 --> 10:05.740
Right now,

10:06.200 --> 10:08.460
they're probably too weak to even get up.

10:12.030 --> 10:13.360
Listen up, Qianyu Army!

10:14.090 --> 10:15.920
Nan Heng poisoned His Majesty

10:16.550 --> 10:18.150
and mobilized private troops to rebel.

10:18.150 --> 10:19.840
His crimes cannot be pardoned.

10:19.840 --> 10:21.000
Today, we shall

10:21.020 --> 10:22.530
act on Heaven's behalf

10:22.750 --> 10:24.210
to eradicate the traitor!

10:24.270 --> 10:25.670
Act on Heaven's behalf!

10:25.670 --> 10:27.030
Eradicate the traitor!

10:27.030 --> 10:28.320
Act on Heaven's behalf!

10:28.320 --> 10:29.630
Eradicate the traitor!

10:29.630 --> 10:31.000
Act on Heaven's behalf!

10:31.000 --> 10:32.390
Eradicate the traitor!

10:32.390 --> 10:33.670
Act on Heaven's behalf!

10:33.670 --> 10:35.080
Eradicate the traitor!

10:36.200 --> 10:37.800
Listen up, Qianyu warriors!

10:39.510 --> 10:40.360
It's Lord Qianyu.

10:40.360 --> 10:41.110
Yes.

10:41.320 --> 10:42.250
It's him indeed.

10:42.320 --> 10:42.910
This...

10:44.740 --> 10:46.210
I'm Lord Qianyu.

10:46.230 --> 10:48.710
My traitorous son, Chu Guihong,
has plotted against His Majesty

10:48.710 --> 10:49.960
and intends to rebel!

10:50.120 --> 10:51.750
All brave warriors, join me

10:51.840 --> 10:52.870
to eradicate the treacherous

10:52.870 --> 10:54.370
and together execute this villain!

10:53.110 --> 10:56.520
♪ The enemy closes in,
so what if the wind howls? ♪

10:54.910 --> 10:56.150
What exactly is going on?

10:56.150 --> 10:56.910
Didn't Junior General say

10:56.910 --> 10:58.390
it was Nan Heng who poisoned His Majesty?

10:57.300 --> 10:59.400
♪ We’ve stood against
the crashing waves of fate ♪

10:58.390 --> 10:58.790
What's going on?

10:58.790 --> 11:00.120
So who should we listen to?

11:00.120 --> 11:01.760
He is Lord Qianyu after all.

11:01.320 --> 11:04.420
♪ Unruly and arrogant ♪

11:01.960 --> 11:04.220
At your command, My Lord!

11:05.070 --> 11:07.250
♪ Trampled yet laughs it off ♪

11:09.170 --> 11:12.460
♪ As a lone wolf,
forget who I'm proud of ♪

11:13.360 --> 11:15.540
♪ I've seen through
countless people's hearts ♪

11:17.050 --> 11:20.230
♪ In this world full of challenges,
I wield my blade ♪

11:21.240 --> 11:23.430
♪ Facing tomorrow, loyal and bold ♪

11:22.870 --> 11:25.070
My acting was pretty decent, wasn't it?

11:25.230 --> 11:27.310
♪ A lamp as bright as the stars ♪

11:28.320 --> 11:29.990
The last two times were held back,

11:28.920 --> 11:31.150
♪ A drop of rain
that gives birth to roots ♪

11:30.120 --> 11:32.580
it was because we lacked
sufficient troops.

11:32.600 --> 11:33.510
But this time,

11:33.030 --> 11:38.920
♪ Experiencing the ups and downs of life
beats reading thousands of books ♪

11:35.150 --> 11:36.810
I need to go see someone first.

11:37.480 --> 11:38.930
No matter who you are,

11:39.000 --> 11:41.030
you can only be Lord Qianyu today.

11:40.480 --> 11:44.370
♪ I'm willing to go with the wind ♪

11:41.440 --> 11:42.190
This...

11:42.360 --> 11:43.500
Lord Qianyu?

11:45.180 --> 11:47.970
♪ And run into the fog with no regrets ♪

11:49.100 --> 11:51.870
♪ Even if rain pours on the path ahead ♪

11:50.100 --> 11:51.500
Fellow Qianyu soldiers!

11:52.890 --> 11:55.480
♪ For this life, for all beings ♪

11:53.390 --> 11:54.870
My father practiced martial arts
for years

11:54.870 --> 11:56.200
and was highly skilled,

11:56.260 --> 11:58.420
♪ Sweeping through a thousand years
of dust ♪

11:56.320 --> 11:59.320
He even sacrificed himself in
the Battle of Pingyang.

12:00.200 --> 12:01.950
yet this man is weak and feeble.

12:02.390 --> 12:03.910
He's clearly an impostor
Nan Heng brought in

12:03.910 --> 12:05.240
to fool us!

12:05.240 --> 12:06.900
There's no way he's my father!

12:07.840 --> 12:10.550
If you haven't forgotten the kindness
my father once showed you,

12:10.550 --> 12:11.680
then fight by my side

12:12.200 --> 12:13.380
and take them down!

12:20.310 --> 12:24.330
[Huanning Hall]

12:31.720 --> 12:32.510
Hide!

12:35.110 --> 12:35.960
Behind you!

12:48.720 --> 12:49.360
Left-hand side!

12:49.360 --> 12:49.840
Is it

12:49.840 --> 12:51.440
your left-hand side or mine?

12:52.870 --> 12:53.560
I...

13:10.440 --> 13:11.280
Jixiang.

13:19.750 --> 13:20.550
Jixiang.

13:20.650 --> 13:21.580
Jixiang.

13:22.270 --> 13:23.200
You can't die.

13:23.200 --> 13:24.030
Jixiang.

13:24.790 --> 13:25.750
I don't ever want to see you

13:25.750 --> 13:26.870
die in front of me again,

13:26.870 --> 13:27.630
Jixiang!

13:29.870 --> 13:30.730
Your Highness.

13:31.750 --> 13:33.610
When did I ever die in front of you?

13:36.050 --> 13:37.000
Your Highness.

13:38.850 --> 13:40.180
It's not hard to kill.

13:40.970 --> 13:42.610
Just think of the one

13:42.750 --> 13:44.550
you'd risk your life to protect,

13:45.320 --> 13:46.510
and just

13:46.840 --> 13:48.240
thrust your sword through.

13:48.240 --> 13:48.720
Okay.

13:48.840 --> 13:49.580
Okay.

13:51.000 --> 13:51.640
Jixiang!

13:51.660 --> 13:52.270
Jixiang!

13:52.300 --> 13:53.290
Jixiang!

13:54.210 --> 13:55.020
Jixiang!

14:10.130 --> 14:12.200
I'll ask you one last time!

14:12.530 --> 14:13.660
The imperial edict,

14:14.000 --> 14:15.330
will you write it or not!

14:15.720 --> 14:17.730
Nan Heng is my son.

14:17.930 --> 14:19.310
What do you think?

14:39.090 --> 14:40.020
Father.

14:40.150 --> 14:41.220
Father.

14:42.520 --> 14:43.890
Here, Father.

14:44.120 --> 14:44.910
Father.

14:44.930 --> 14:45.900
It's okay.

14:45.960 --> 14:46.770
Don't be afraid.

14:46.770 --> 14:47.960
I'm here.

14:48.060 --> 14:49.290
I'm here.

15:02.710 --> 15:04.310
Just this handful of people?

15:04.830 --> 15:06.440
Like ants trying to shake a tree,

15:06.440 --> 15:07.640
utterly overconfident.

15:07.640 --> 15:10.240
Who said there're only
this handful of people?

15:12.320 --> 15:13.340
I, Passerby A,

15:13.360 --> 15:16.390
am willing to assist Your Highness in
rooting out traitors and villains!

15:16.390 --> 15:17.360
I, Passerby B,

15:17.380 --> 15:19.720
would like to lend a hand
to the Nightwalkers!

15:19.720 --> 15:20.720
I, Passerby D,

15:20.740 --> 15:22.940
have no intention of coming back alive!

15:23.270 --> 15:24.360
I, Passerby F,

15:24.360 --> 15:25.760
will fight you to the end!

15:26.790 --> 15:27.670
I, Nameless,

15:27.670 --> 15:28.870
am determined to make my mark

15:28.870 --> 15:29.870
in South City today!

15:29.870 --> 15:32.270
I, Folk D, swear to follow Your Highness
to the death!

15:32.270 --> 15:34.200
And me, Lantern-selling Old Lady!

15:34.320 --> 15:35.120
And me,

15:35.140 --> 15:36.760
Butcher Zhang from West City!

15:36.760 --> 15:38.410
Midwife Wang from East City!

15:38.840 --> 15:42.080
We pledge to help Your Highness
root out traitors and villains!

15:42.080 --> 15:45.200
We pledge to help Your Highness
root out traitors and villains!

15:45.200 --> 15:48.510
We pledge to help Your Highness
root out traitors and villains!

15:48.510 --> 15:52.040
We pledge to help Your Highness
root out traitors and villains!

16:01.120 --> 16:03.910
We pledge to help Your Highness
root out traitors and villains!

16:03.910 --> 16:04.600
What's going on?

16:04.600 --> 16:05.480
Yeah, what happened?

16:05.480 --> 16:06.120
Exactly.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.240
Chu Guihong.

16:08.840 --> 16:09.840
These people

16:10.080 --> 16:11.440
have all benefited from

16:11.550 --> 16:13.600
the Nightwalkers' and Nan Heng's goodwill.

16:13.600 --> 16:14.960
But they are not here today

16:14.960 --> 16:16.360
to repay the favor.

16:17.000 --> 16:18.480
To them,

16:19.510 --> 16:21.710
whoever dragged the Great Jing into war

16:21.960 --> 16:23.820
and made the people homeless

16:23.850 --> 16:25.500
is their true enemy!

16:25.670 --> 16:26.120
Right!

16:26.120 --> 16:27.510
Well said!

16:27.510 --> 16:28.240
That's right!

16:28.240 --> 16:29.150
Well said!

16:29.150 --> 16:30.600
Soldiers!

16:31.600 --> 16:33.120
My son, Han Sihu,

16:33.630 --> 16:37.170
once fought alongside Lord Qianyu
in countless battles,

16:37.250 --> 16:40.430
and my father, Han Pingliang,
shed blood at the border.

16:40.550 --> 16:42.080
I just don't understand.

16:42.320 --> 16:44.430
Why do you aim your killing blades

16:44.510 --> 16:46.490
at our own people

16:46.670 --> 16:49.640
instead of the external enemies?

16:55.710 --> 16:58.340
♪ Beyond my control, powerless to resist ♪

16:59.190 --> 17:01.770
♪ Yet still I dig deep, questioning fate ♪

17:01.150 --> 17:02.150
Dear soldiers!

17:02.720 --> 17:06.060
♪ That is the meaning behind my defiance ♪

17:03.360 --> 17:04.579
You all used to be

17:04.720 --> 17:05.829
faithful patriots

17:06.030 --> 17:07.550
and border defenders.

17:08.109 --> 17:09.000
A true man

17:09.680 --> 17:10.930
stands for his country.

17:09.720 --> 17:12.319
♪ Even doomed for eternity,
I still have the courage ♪

17:11.510 --> 17:12.770
Are you really going to

17:13.000 --> 17:15.470
♪ For you, I’d step into the uncertainty ♪

17:13.109 --> 17:15.310
stray down the wrong path

17:15.920 --> 17:17.109
for someone scheming to usurp power today?

17:16.609 --> 17:19.980
♪ If you believe in fate ♪

17:19.720 --> 17:20.710
I, Nan Heng,

17:21.200 --> 17:22.310
promise you all that

17:21.730 --> 17:24.310
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

17:22.750 --> 17:23.550
today,

17:24.440 --> 17:25.660
we'll only kill the culprit,

17:25.160 --> 17:27.660
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

17:25.880 --> 17:26.920
but not the loyal.

17:27.790 --> 17:29.200
Whoever defects from evil
and joins the just cause

17:28.660 --> 17:31.870
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

17:30.270 --> 17:31.870
will be treated as innocent!

17:32.880 --> 17:34.720
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

17:35.760 --> 17:38.310
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

17:39.240 --> 17:43.360
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

17:44.230 --> 17:47.410
♪ To give you a love
etched into the bones ♪

17:48.560 --> 17:49.470
♪ Then it's not something to
grieve over ♪

17:49.930 --> 17:51.170
♪ No matter how many times
day and night cycle ♪

17:51.550 --> 17:53.160
♪ I'll face all the slings and arrows
head-on ♪

17:51.990 --> 17:54.100
So now, even you're turning
your backs on me?

17:53.490 --> 17:55.010
♪ Even ants can bring down a mighty tree ♪

17:55.220 --> 17:56.570
♪ So don't rush to judge my place ♪

17:56.850 --> 17:58.690
♪ If I'm but a speck of dust
in this world ♪

17:59.130 --> 18:00.440
♪ I'll still rise, carried by the blaze ♪

18:00.890 --> 18:02.220
♪ Only when your scornful eyes
feel the sting ♪

18:02.570 --> 18:04.070
♪ Will you finally see who I truly am ♪

18:16.970 --> 18:18.850
Don't you have confidence in Chief?

18:18.850 --> 18:20.190
He can handle it.

18:20.600 --> 18:23.280
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

18:24.240 --> 18:26.680
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

18:27.810 --> 18:30.760
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

18:31.480 --> 18:32.420
Mrs. Li.

18:31.770 --> 18:34.170
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

18:32.450 --> 18:33.510
Have you noticed that

18:33.510 --> 18:35.740
Chief's backlash power
has already weakened?

18:35.240 --> 18:37.630
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

18:35.960 --> 18:36.880
Don't worry.

18:36.900 --> 18:38.580
Chu Guihong is no match for him.

18:38.580 --> 18:42.850
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

18:43.600 --> 18:47.170
♪ To give you a love
etched into the bones ♪

18:47.930 --> 18:49.050
♪ Then it's not something to
grieve over ♪

18:50.190 --> 18:54.840
♪ If tears are proof that I once loved ♪

18:57.320 --> 19:03.200
♪ If what's gone leaves behind
a trace of being ♪

19:04.710 --> 19:06.470
♪ Then let the tears fall ♪

19:07.210 --> 19:09.060
♪ Let me love you ♪

19:09.910 --> 19:15.300
♪ And fade away with one last dream ♪

19:18.340 --> 19:21.130
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

19:22.070 --> 19:24.360
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

19:25.200 --> 19:28.600
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

19:29.500 --> 19:31.170
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

19:31.880 --> 19:35.310
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

19:36.130 --> 19:40.430
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

19:41.230 --> 19:44.780
♪ To give you a love
etched into the bones ♪

19:45.680 --> 19:48.270
♪ Then it's not something to
grieve over ♪

19:50.640 --> 19:51.700
Chu Guihong,

19:52.310 --> 19:53.710
You plotted a rebellion,

19:54.050 --> 19:55.850
a crime that cannot be pardoned.

19:56.830 --> 19:58.290
But I won't kill you today.

19:58.750 --> 20:00.000
Everything will be left

20:00.000 --> 20:01.400
to His Majesty to decide.

20:27.490 --> 20:28.860
You won't kill me?

20:30.790 --> 20:33.020
Cut the act.

20:33.720 --> 20:35.270
Isn't this exactly what you wanted?

20:35.270 --> 20:36.440
To see me condemned by the whole world

20:36.440 --> 20:38.100
and trampled under your feet?

20:39.350 --> 20:40.210
Are you

20:41.240 --> 20:42.480
happy now?

20:45.110 --> 20:47.240
You brought all of this upon yourself.

21:01.400 --> 21:02.200
Yes.

21:05.370 --> 21:06.540
I'm the one

21:07.990 --> 21:09.750
who chose my own path.

21:14.760 --> 21:16.460
Heaven shows no justice,

21:17.350 --> 21:20.000
so what wrong is there in me, Chu Guihong,

21:20.000 --> 21:21.660
fighting for my own survival?

22:00.960 --> 22:01.680
Nan Heng.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.400
Look.

22:02.590 --> 22:03.850
This is the Great Jing,

22:04.510 --> 22:05.770
the land our Chu family

22:05.960 --> 22:07.030
and your Nan family

22:07.310 --> 22:09.840
have safeguarded together for generations.

22:09.920 --> 22:11.050
Isn't it beautiful?

22:13.000 --> 22:13.790
In the future,

22:13.790 --> 22:14.880
when we grow up,

22:14.880 --> 22:17.480
we'll protect the land
of the Great Jing together, too.

22:17.480 --> 22:18.680
We'll ride big horses

22:18.920 --> 22:20.070
and wield heavy swords,

22:20.070 --> 22:22.800
slashing the enemy
till they’re running scared,

22:23.680 --> 22:24.920
so that everyone in the Great Jing

22:24.920 --> 22:25.680
knows our names,

22:25.680 --> 22:27.640
Nan Heng and Chu Guihong.

22:28.480 --> 22:29.590
How does that sound?

22:29.590 --> 22:30.400
Sounds great.

23:36.110 --> 23:37.160
Mr. Screenwriter.

23:37.160 --> 23:39.160
Didn't you say that you could wipe out

23:39.160 --> 23:41.690
thousands of fictional characters
with just a flick of your wrist?

23:41.690 --> 23:42.680
But in the end,

23:42.680 --> 23:44.510
you still helped us

23:44.680 --> 23:46.140
as a fictional character.

23:47.160 --> 23:48.830
Who said I'm a fictional character?

23:48.830 --> 23:51.490
I'm the God of War of the Great Jing,
Lord Qianyu.

23:52.240 --> 23:53.550
Then may I ask, Lord Qianyu,

23:53.550 --> 23:54.960
why are you still here?

23:55.200 --> 23:57.200
Expecting me to stick with you
through all the iconic scenes?

23:57.200 --> 23:58.480
How dare I?

24:00.270 --> 24:02.130
I just came to realize something.

24:02.780 --> 24:03.930
You're right.

24:04.200 --> 24:05.550
In this world,

24:05.680 --> 24:06.680
no matter if you're the lead,

24:06.680 --> 24:07.240
a supporting character,

24:07.240 --> 24:08.270
or just a nobody,

24:08.440 --> 24:10.040
everyone is a living person.

24:10.310 --> 24:12.200
I was too shallow before,

24:12.200 --> 24:13.400
always stubbornly trying

24:13.400 --> 24:15.200
to dictate everyone's destiny.

24:17.030 --> 24:18.750
It's good that you realize that.

24:18.750 --> 24:19.310
By the way,

24:19.310 --> 24:20.110
let me ask you.

24:20.240 --> 24:22.510
Does the script rule still exist?

24:22.960 --> 24:24.270
Why does Nan Heng

24:24.270 --> 24:25.600
seem to have recovered?

24:25.880 --> 24:26.720
Actually,

24:26.880 --> 24:28.920
many things have changed long ago.

24:30.250 --> 24:31.710
Think about it carefully.

24:32.110 --> 24:34.640
It's been a while since you last heard
the sound of typing, right?

24:34.640 --> 24:37.550
When Nan Heng disrupted the original
rule mechanism with a new one,

24:37.550 --> 24:39.550
the old rules like "the male lead must
save the heroine in danger"

24:39.550 --> 24:42.080
and "iconic scenes must play out
as scripted"

24:42.110 --> 24:43.640
had already ceased to work.

24:44.070 --> 24:45.200
Besides,

24:45.200 --> 24:46.810
now that all the fictional characters
have awakened,

24:46.810 --> 24:47.880
the rule that "anyone who
alters iconic scenes

24:47.880 --> 24:49.310
will suffer backlash"

24:49.310 --> 24:50.240
has also lost its effect.

24:50.240 --> 24:51.160
In other words,

24:51.180 --> 24:51.980
now,

24:52.010 --> 24:53.910
not only are you no longer
controlled by fate,

24:53.910 --> 24:55.190
I'm free from it too.

24:56.300 --> 24:58.050
Just now, when I saw the people

24:58.590 --> 25:01.480
risking their lives
to protect their homeland,

25:02.070 --> 25:03.400
I suddenly felt...

25:04.480 --> 25:06.880
Felt like I had an out-of-body experience.

25:08.110 --> 25:09.370
Yeah, right.

25:09.440 --> 25:11.110
Out-of-body experience? Give me a break.

25:11.110 --> 25:12.370
It's true.

25:12.830 --> 25:13.890
Maybe in a few days,

25:14.030 --> 25:15.550
you won't be able to find me anymore.

25:15.550 --> 25:17.150
I'll already be back by then.

25:19.480 --> 25:20.200
Okay then.

25:20.200 --> 25:21.260
I wish you'll never

25:21.880 --> 25:23.730
write a lousy script again.

25:23.880 --> 25:24.440
Goodbye.

25:29.000 --> 25:29.740
Forget it.

25:30.480 --> 25:31.310
Give me a hug,

25:31.310 --> 25:32.370
Mr. Screenwriter.

25:34.750 --> 25:36.000
Why are they hugging?

25:36.000 --> 25:36.500
Chief.

25:36.520 --> 25:37.480
I'll go chop his hand off.

25:37.480 --> 25:38.160
No need.

25:38.810 --> 25:39.870
I'll go beat him up.

25:42.240 --> 25:42.980
I'm off.

25:45.480 --> 25:46.100
Let's go.

25:50.600 --> 25:52.890
Didn't he say he wanted to beat him?

25:53.030 --> 25:53.590
This...

25:53.590 --> 25:55.790
Is it so easy to make a married man happy?

26:07.390 --> 26:09.170
[Huaipu Hall]

26:09.190 --> 26:15.730
[A few days later]

26:34.360 --> 26:35.220
Your Highness.

26:45.350 --> 26:46.640
After that day,

26:47.030 --> 26:49.110
Bixiong really traveled back
to the modern times.

26:49.110 --> 26:50.070
Before he left,

26:50.070 --> 26:51.470
he kept reminding me that

26:52.270 --> 26:53.300
if this world

26:53.550 --> 26:56.230
were to have tremendous changes one day,

26:56.720 --> 26:58.780
it definitely wouldn't be his doing.

26:58.880 --> 27:01.140
Because everything in this script world

27:01.310 --> 27:02.680
has long been handed over

27:02.680 --> 27:04.160
to each individual here.

27:08.080 --> 27:12.150
[Yingqiu and Zhixia's
Destiny-Altering Plan]

27:14.680 --> 27:15.540
Your Highness.

27:16.400 --> 27:17.520
Didn't you say

27:17.590 --> 27:20.140
our fate is in our own hands?

27:21.000 --> 27:22.150
Then tell us,

27:22.240 --> 27:23.380
who will

27:23.480 --> 27:25.080
Zhixia and I marry in the end?

27:26.830 --> 27:29.880
According to the typical
balance-of-pairing logic in dramas,

27:29.480 --> 27:33.790
[Yingqiu and Zhixia's
Destiny-Altering Plan]

27:30.030 --> 27:31.700
you two should end up with

27:31.830 --> 27:32.790
characters like Yunlong, Shanhu,

27:32.790 --> 27:34.110
Jixiang, or Fugui.

27:35.160 --> 27:36.960
Then I'd rather not get married.

27:37.830 --> 27:39.680
Balance-of-pairing logic?

27:39.790 --> 27:40.590
What is that?

27:41.200 --> 27:44.240
It basically means the male lead
ends up with the female lead,

27:44.240 --> 27:46.480
the male lead's best friend pairs with
the female lead's bestie,

27:46.480 --> 27:49.240
and the male lead's servant gets matched
with the female lead's maid.

27:49.240 --> 27:50.640
Basically,

27:50.640 --> 27:52.500
just the same old cliché formula.

27:52.750 --> 27:53.900
Well,

27:56.310 --> 27:57.170
Your Highness,

27:57.680 --> 27:58.280
are there

27:58.310 --> 28:00.060
unbalanced parings?

28:00.200 --> 28:01.790
Unbalanced pairings?

28:03.000 --> 28:03.720
I guess

28:03.720 --> 28:04.480
there are.

28:09.550 --> 28:10.570
Yingqiu.

28:11.270 --> 28:13.670
Who are you hoping to be
"unbalanced" with?

28:14.710 --> 28:16.620
[Yingqiu and Zhixia's
Destiny-Altering Plan]

28:16.690 --> 28:18.760
[Yingqiu]

28:29.310 --> 28:30.640
Why is she running away?

28:35.750 --> 28:37.260
Casting a wide net

28:37.750 --> 28:39.200
to catch big fish?

28:42.240 --> 28:43.350
Quite impressive.

28:52.240 --> 28:53.030
Jixiang.

28:53.350 --> 28:55.240
You just recovered after resting
for three months.

28:55.240 --> 28:56.900
Can you really work like this?

28:56.960 --> 28:58.690
I've recovered for a long time.

29:00.880 --> 29:01.880
Come on, Jixiang.

29:06.310 --> 29:07.250
Jixiang.

29:07.510 --> 29:09.260
Tell me, why is there such an excellent

29:09.260 --> 29:10.270
chosen one as me

29:10.270 --> 29:12.790
in our Great Jing Dynasty?

29:14.000 --> 29:15.270
In terms of being a prince,

29:15.270 --> 29:17.220
I'm as good as Heng.

29:17.270 --> 29:18.110
And when it comes to growing rice,

29:18.110 --> 29:18.880
I accidentally became

29:18.880 --> 29:20.120
the best in the world.

29:20.790 --> 29:22.310
You didn't see it.

29:22.310 --> 29:23.480
When the Deputy Director of
the Ministry of Revenue

29:23.480 --> 29:24.480
saw me yesterday,

29:24.550 --> 29:26.270
he showed 30% respect

29:26.440 --> 29:27.920
and 70% admiration.

29:28.030 --> 29:28.880
So,

29:28.920 --> 29:30.720
when it comes to ensuring
the people's prosperity,

29:30.720 --> 29:31.480
Heng

29:31.480 --> 29:32.740
still has to rely on me.

29:46.060 --> 29:46.890
It's you?

29:54.640 --> 29:56.550
Your Highness! Your Highness!

29:56.550 --> 29:57.640
Are you alright, Your Highness?

29:57.640 --> 29:59.370
Your Highness. Your Highness.

30:01.160 --> 30:03.110
And so, the story of Yingqiu and Nan Rui

30:03.110 --> 30:05.340
began in such a magical way.

30:06.110 --> 30:08.640
Yingqiu longs for simple and pure love.

30:08.770 --> 30:09.940
So does Nan Rui.

30:10.750 --> 30:12.390
But as for Zhixia,

30:12.680 --> 30:13.660
she believes that love

30:13.660 --> 30:15.030
is like a cotton jacket in summer

30:15.030 --> 30:15.960
or a fan in winter.

30:15.960 --> 30:17.240
It can't solve urgent problems,

30:17.240 --> 30:18.720
nor does it bring any extra value.

30:18.720 --> 30:20.890
If anything is truly meaningful,

30:21.440 --> 30:22.820
it has to be

30:23.000 --> 30:23.800
making money.

30:25.310 --> 30:26.480
47.

30:26.640 --> 30:27.440
78.

30:28.240 --> 30:29.270
356.

30:30.550 --> 30:31.520
621.

30:31.550 --> 30:32.350
701.

30:33.070 --> 30:34.670
Have you memorized them all?

30:34.750 --> 30:35.550
Not yet.

30:35.640 --> 30:36.630
Chief Master.

30:37.110 --> 30:38.030
Look,

30:38.030 --> 30:39.200
you've been checking the ledger all day.

30:39.200 --> 30:40.790
You should give your hands a break.

30:40.790 --> 30:41.400
Why not

30:41.480 --> 30:42.610
have some tea first?

30:43.270 --> 30:44.880
Do you think this is something
I want to do as Chief Master?

30:44.880 --> 30:46.170
If even one of you men

30:46.190 --> 30:47.390
were any good,

30:47.420 --> 30:48.290
would I really have to

30:48.290 --> 30:50.190
do this work myself?

30:53.640 --> 30:55.270
You actually had the nerve

30:55.270 --> 30:56.090
to show me a spreadsheet like this?

30:56.090 --> 30:57.550
Take it back and revise it.

31:00.070 --> 31:01.110
In one official document,

31:01.110 --> 31:02.370
there are eight typos.

31:02.480 --> 31:04.560
Did your P.E. teacher teach you Chinese?

31:04.560 --> 31:05.760
What's your problem?

31:08.910 --> 31:11.140
[On May 18, a zither gathering will be
held at the Waning River Crescent's Hall.]

31:08.910 --> 31:11.140
[We respectfully hope Your Honor
will kindly spare time to attend.]

31:12.550 --> 31:13.510
Yunlong.

31:13.830 --> 31:15.830
An invitation without the name of
the person you want to invite?

31:15.830 --> 31:16.790
Are you inviting ghosts or what?

31:16.790 --> 31:17.840
We can't even invite any guest over.

31:17.840 --> 31:18.820
How exactly should we grow and
strengthen our business?

31:18.820 --> 31:19.820
Look at you all.

31:20.030 --> 31:21.880
It was Second Master who wrote this.

31:21.880 --> 31:22.920
Actually, this form

31:22.920 --> 31:24.750
was also assigned to me by Second Master.

31:24.750 --> 31:25.870
As well as this official document.

31:25.870 --> 31:26.860
Second Master also said that

31:26.860 --> 31:28.240
all the opportunities should
be left to the young people.

31:28.240 --> 31:29.240
-Yes.
-Right.

31:29.270 --> 31:30.440
That's right, Chief Master.

31:30.440 --> 31:31.920
They're telling the truth.

31:31.920 --> 31:32.750
Where is Shangguan He?

31:32.750 --> 31:33.350
Where is he?

31:33.350 --> 31:34.110
Where?

31:34.200 --> 31:35.110
Where!

31:37.550 --> 31:39.860
Accompanying his wife upstairs.

32:03.790 --> 32:04.590
Yiting,

32:05.270 --> 32:06.200
I want to

32:06.200 --> 32:06.720
discuss something with you...

32:06.720 --> 32:07.250
Go ahead.

32:08.960 --> 32:11.860
Didn't you say a while ago
you wanted to have a child?

32:12.200 --> 32:13.830
Look, I'm so dashing and charming,

32:13.830 --> 32:15.070
and you are so talented and versatile.

32:15.070 --> 32:16.470
Shouldn't we hurry up and

32:17.110 --> 32:19.170
create the next world's female lead?

32:21.400 --> 32:22.200
What?

32:22.680 --> 32:23.590
Are you not satisfied,

32:23.590 --> 32:25.310
being a supporting character?

32:25.310 --> 32:26.880
Do you want to flip the table?

32:26.880 --> 32:28.350
That's not what I meant.

32:28.750 --> 32:29.550
I just...

32:31.700 --> 32:33.040
Like you.

32:34.400 --> 32:35.760
Stop pretending.

32:35.830 --> 32:37.730
You just feel you're not free around me.

32:37.730 --> 32:39.400
You want to use a child to get rid of me,

32:39.400 --> 32:40.510
and then go back to

32:40.510 --> 32:42.030
your old wandering, carefree life,

32:42.030 --> 32:42.510
right?

32:42.510 --> 32:43.640
No, no.

32:45.830 --> 32:46.640
But

32:47.000 --> 32:48.720
it's not entirely unacceptable.

32:48.720 --> 32:50.310
Isn't Chu Li the screenwriter?

32:50.310 --> 32:51.280
Before he left,

32:51.300 --> 32:53.020
I made a wish to him,

32:54.390 --> 32:56.620
wishing men could get pregnant too.

33:01.350 --> 33:03.590
After you've carried the baby
for 10 months,

33:03.590 --> 33:05.310
you can go wherever you want.

33:05.550 --> 33:07.150
I definitely won't stop you.

33:08.000 --> 33:10.800
No wonder I feel like
I've gained weight recently.

33:11.200 --> 33:12.800
You're not serious, are you?

33:15.000 --> 33:16.460
You really made that wish?

33:19.750 --> 33:20.440
Yiting!

33:20.960 --> 33:22.480
Don't joke with me.

33:22.550 --> 33:23.010
Yiting.

33:23.110 --> 33:23.710
Yiting.

33:24.920 --> 33:25.750
You're not serious, right?

33:25.750 --> 33:27.070
Tell me you're not serious.

33:27.070 --> 33:27.720
I am.

33:27.810 --> 33:30.070
I'm not ready to step into this stage yet.

33:31.550 --> 33:32.430
Tell me.

33:32.430 --> 33:33.890
-Is it true?
-Walk slowly.

33:34.000 --> 33:35.200
Don't upset the baby.

33:35.240 --> 33:36.030
This...

33:36.130 --> 33:37.790
You almost scared me to death.

33:41.590 --> 33:43.000
Check this out.

33:43.310 --> 33:44.200
I instantly liked it

33:44.200 --> 33:45.920
back in Yangzhou.

33:45.940 --> 33:47.410
Don't you think this color

33:47.440 --> 33:49.510
suits the skin tone of people our age
very well?

33:49.510 --> 33:50.310
Let me see.

33:51.200 --> 33:52.730
The color is really pretty.

33:52.790 --> 33:53.550
I think

33:53.550 --> 33:54.640
we should put it on

33:54.680 --> 33:56.510
all our sisters later,

33:56.510 --> 33:58.700
and then we go shopping together.

33:58.830 --> 34:00.160
According to Yimeng,

34:00.310 --> 34:01.960
this is called "live selling."

34:01.960 --> 34:03.240
Good idea.

34:03.310 --> 34:04.190
Tomorrow,

34:04.220 --> 34:05.200
I'll go to Yangzhou

34:05.200 --> 34:06.750
and bring in another carriage of goods.

34:06.750 --> 34:07.030
Okay.

34:07.030 --> 34:08.280
I'm sure they'll sell really well.

34:08.280 --> 34:08.960
Okay.

34:09.360 --> 34:10.230
Noble Consort.

34:10.800 --> 34:13.250
You haven't come to see me
for three months.

34:13.320 --> 34:14.190
If this goes on,

34:14.190 --> 34:15.760
you might even forget

34:15.760 --> 34:16.800
what I look like,

34:16.880 --> 34:17.670
right?

34:18.030 --> 34:19.120
Darling.

34:19.590 --> 34:20.440
No matter how nice this place is,

34:20.440 --> 34:21.920
it's not your home.

34:22.670 --> 34:24.199
Even if you don't miss me,

34:24.460 --> 34:25.360
you should miss

34:25.360 --> 34:28.020
the flowers and plants
you usually take care of.

34:35.550 --> 34:36.360
Take this.

34:39.570 --> 34:42.370
[Divorce Letter]

34:39.760 --> 34:40.880
As for a loveless marriage,

34:40.880 --> 34:42.440
I'd rather not have it.

34:43.800 --> 34:45.090
What's yours?

34:45.400 --> 34:47.550
[Divorce Letter]

34:45.630 --> 34:46.670
The world is vast.

34:46.670 --> 34:47.909
I want to explore it.

34:47.980 --> 34:49.639
What's this supposed to mean?

34:50.230 --> 34:51.230
Don't just stand there.

34:51.230 --> 34:52.030
Go after her.

34:52.030 --> 34:52.840
Why?

34:53.840 --> 34:55.199
It's the
"too-late-to-win-her-back" scenario.

34:55.199 --> 34:55.920
You don't even know this?

34:55.920 --> 34:56.630
What a fossil.

34:56.630 --> 34:57.470
Darling!

34:59.070 --> 34:59.760
Noble Consort!

34:59.760 --> 35:00.710
Darling!

35:00.760 --> 35:01.440
Noble Consort!

35:01.270 --> 35:06.190
♪ Who drinks in the wind as
snow turns to ash? ♪

35:01.440 --> 35:02.760
Darling, wait for me!

35:02.760 --> 35:03.280
Noble Consort!

35:03.280 --> 35:03.920
Darling!

35:04.400 --> 35:05.880
Wait for me!

35:06.280 --> 35:07.540
Darling!

35:07.100 --> 35:07.570
[Yingxing Gate]

35:07.570 --> 35:12.740
[Frontier, Pingrong City]

35:08.150 --> 35:09.200
As for Fugui,

35:09.730 --> 35:10.590
he said

35:10.920 --> 35:13.150
he had fought war alongside Nan Heng
all his life.

35:13.150 --> 35:14.920
He used to assist Nan Heng

35:14.920 --> 35:17.030
in safeguarding Youcheng and
the Seventh Prince's Residence.

35:17.030 --> 35:18.150
Wherever Nan Heng is,

35:18.150 --> 35:19.600
that's where his home is.

35:19.710 --> 35:20.750
But now,

35:20.960 --> 35:23.690
Nan Heng holds the entire Great Jing
in his heart.

35:24.290 --> 35:25.060
Therefore,

35:25.880 --> 35:27.680
the border gate of the Great Jing

35:27.840 --> 35:29.170
should still be guarded

35:29.590 --> 35:30.900
by Fugui.

35:31.440 --> 35:32.400
Except this and this,

35:32.400 --> 35:32.920
I want everything else.

35:32.920 --> 35:33.400
Fugui.

35:33.400 --> 35:33.960
Yes.

35:36.360 --> 35:37.530
Fugui.

35:38.800 --> 35:39.730
Long time no see.

35:40.230 --> 35:42.040
You've grown even more capable.

35:42.710 --> 35:44.840
Sharp as an eagle, fierce as a tiger.

35:45.030 --> 35:46.510
You fully embody the presence
of a great general.

35:46.510 --> 35:48.110
The treasured sword lies...

35:49.760 --> 35:50.490
In its blade.

35:51.190 --> 35:53.550
What a spirit that could
engulf vast rivers and mountains.

35:53.550 --> 35:54.540
Hey, Yao Qian.

35:54.670 --> 35:56.000
What are you doing here?

35:56.670 --> 35:59.230
To protect the 3,000 soldiers
I recently recruited

35:59.230 --> 36:01.230
to join the Xuanjia Army, of course.

36:01.710 --> 36:02.590
In the future,

36:02.590 --> 36:05.070
I'll be your deputy general.

36:05.070 --> 36:06.800
I look forward to your
guidance and support.

36:06.800 --> 36:07.510
Stop.

36:07.510 --> 36:08.510
What do you mean "guidance and support"?

36:08.510 --> 36:09.590
Just take your shoes and go.

36:09.590 --> 36:10.030
Wha...

36:10.030 --> 36:10.520
I'm off.

36:10.770 --> 36:11.170
Fugui.

36:11.190 --> 36:12.920
Go tell His Majesty and Her Majesty that

36:12.920 --> 36:14.110
the border is peaceful.

36:14.110 --> 36:16.030
It's just the newly appointed
Deputy General of the Xuanjia Army

36:16.030 --> 36:16.960
talks too much nonsense.

36:16.960 --> 36:17.440
Yes.

36:17.630 --> 36:18.320
Fugui.

36:18.340 --> 36:19.960
You accuse me of
talking too much nonsense.

36:19.960 --> 36:22.280
I honestly can't make sense of it.

36:23.670 --> 36:24.840
Peace on the border

36:25.030 --> 36:26.760
and prosperity for the people.

36:26.760 --> 36:29.000
This is the Great Jing that
Nan Heng longs for,

36:29.000 --> 36:30.320
and the peace that

36:30.320 --> 36:31.720
everyone here hopes for.

36:32.590 --> 36:34.070
With his father abdicating the throne,

36:34.070 --> 36:35.630
Nan Heng ascended as the new emperor,

36:35.630 --> 36:37.990
thus fulfilling his long-held promise

36:38.070 --> 36:40.270
to protect all the people under heaven.

36:46.000 --> 36:46.730
Are you okay?

36:47.100 --> 36:48.100
Yeah, I'm okay.

36:55.360 --> 36:56.450
And I

36:57.070 --> 36:59.280
finally became a top female celebrity

36:59.330 --> 37:01.010
and walked the red carpet.

37:02.110 --> 37:02.920
But

37:02.920 --> 37:05.360
do you think just because he took me down
the red carpet once,

37:05.360 --> 37:06.340
I'm supposed to be the Empress
of Great Jing

37:06.340 --> 37:08.450
managing his harem

37:08.500 --> 37:10.340
♪ They say the Seventh Prince
is a god in the story ♪

37:08.510 --> 37:10.880
and playing the noble matriarch?

37:10.880 --> 37:12.070
Of course not.

37:11.200 --> 37:13.200
♪ They say the Seventh Prince
is already yours ♪

37:13.800 --> 37:15.920
♪ Seventh Prince,
how much do you love me? ♪

37:13.950 --> 37:15.850
[One month later]

37:16.330 --> 37:18.420
[Two months later]

37:16.730 --> 37:18.710
♪ Here I present you
the yummy candied haws ♪

37:18.770 --> 37:21.110
[Three months later]

37:26.710 --> 37:27.440
Give it to me.

37:28.710 --> 37:30.840
Where did Song Yimeng go?

37:31.920 --> 37:33.150
Don't worry, Your Majesty.

37:33.150 --> 37:35.360
I know Her Majesty's whereabouts.

37:36.550 --> 37:37.280
Where is she?

37:43.950 --> 37:44.960
Your Majesty.

37:44.960 --> 37:45.760
Two months ago,

37:45.760 --> 37:48.360
a spy once saw Her Majesty
on the street of Weicheng City.

37:48.360 --> 37:51.360
They said she was teaching the people

37:51.440 --> 37:52.670
how to use shared carriages.

37:52.670 --> 37:53.870
Shared carriages?

37:54.190 --> 37:55.000
Your Majesty.

37:55.000 --> 37:55.920
Last month,

37:55.920 --> 37:56.840
Her Majesty started something called

37:56.840 --> 37:58.630
"Paper-Link Recruitment" in Jiangnan.

37:58.630 --> 38:01.030
It's said that any woman looking for work

38:01.030 --> 38:03.030
can register her skills there,

38:03.030 --> 38:04.890
and someone will reach out to her.

38:06.880 --> 38:09.430
What on earth is Song Yimeng up to?

38:14.110 --> 38:14.840
Your Majesty.

38:14.840 --> 38:16.000
Her Majesty is back.

38:22.000 --> 38:23.000
Nan Heng!

38:23.130 --> 38:24.090
Nan Heng.

38:24.280 --> 38:25.320
I'm back.

38:30.030 --> 38:31.000
You're back.

38:33.070 --> 38:34.630
Wait, it's summer,

38:34.710 --> 38:36.040
yet you're wearing fur,

38:36.320 --> 38:37.580
holding a hand warmer,

38:37.880 --> 38:39.320
and sitting by a brazier.

38:39.510 --> 38:40.630
Don't you feel hot?

38:42.880 --> 38:44.140
What's wrong with you?

38:45.440 --> 38:47.300
I don't know if it's the backlash.

38:47.670 --> 38:49.590
I've been feeling cold
all the time lately.

38:49.590 --> 38:50.280
Besides,

38:50.360 --> 38:51.970
I can't sleep all night.

38:52.920 --> 38:55.120
Even my bones ache deep into the marrow.

39:05.550 --> 39:06.590
Right.

39:06.760 --> 39:08.000
It hurts so much

39:08.000 --> 39:09.480
that you're even sweating cold sweat.

39:09.480 --> 39:10.920
Stop pretending.

39:13.000 --> 39:14.860
Why don't you care about me at all?

39:15.110 --> 39:16.620
I do care about you.

39:17.150 --> 39:18.480
I care about you a lot.

39:18.480 --> 39:19.710
Come on, wear more.

39:19.740 --> 39:20.510
Make yourself warm. Come on.

39:20.510 --> 39:21.110
It's hot.

39:21.110 --> 39:21.880
Put it on for me.

39:21.880 --> 39:22.630
You don't feel cold anymore?

39:22.630 --> 39:23.260
No.

39:26.880 --> 39:29.780
I've just been too busy these days.

39:30.110 --> 39:31.440
You promised me that day

39:31.760 --> 39:33.400
you'd stay in the palace with me
for half a month

39:33.400 --> 39:35.400
and then do your own stuff
for the other half.

39:35.400 --> 39:37.190
But you've been gone for three months.

39:37.190 --> 39:38.080
And I have to hear about you

39:38.080 --> 39:39.390
from other people.

39:39.710 --> 39:40.880
I've been away for three months?

39:40.880 --> 39:41.560
Yes.

39:48.360 --> 39:49.220
Nan Heng.

39:49.360 --> 39:51.000
It's just three months.

39:51.000 --> 39:53.730
It's only about the time it takes
to shoot a drama.

39:54.000 --> 39:55.720
If I knew you were so clingy,

39:56.000 --> 39:58.100
I would've stayed in the crew

39:58.320 --> 39:59.920
and film with Nan Feng for three months.

39:59.920 --> 40:01.710
What do you mean Nan Feng,
some kind of wind?

40:01.710 --> 40:02.510
Is he better-looking than me?

40:02.510 --> 40:03.640
Is he taller than me?

40:04.150 --> 40:05.230
He's nowhere...

40:08.180 --> 40:11.350
Nowhere near as good-looking as you.

40:14.630 --> 40:16.530
That guy looks like a compass.

40:16.650 --> 40:17.630
How could I possibly

40:17.630 --> 40:19.480
abandon my cute husband

40:19.550 --> 40:21.190
and like a compass instead?

40:21.400 --> 40:22.030
Right?

40:26.710 --> 40:28.860
But I heard from the screenwriter that

40:29.030 --> 40:30.900
during filming,

40:31.070 --> 40:32.750
you actors film quite a lot of

40:33.410 --> 40:34.630
intimate scenes.

40:37.550 --> 40:40.280
Mr. Screenwriter, how kind of you.

40:41.110 --> 40:41.960
You've left,

40:41.960 --> 40:43.560
yet you set me up for trouble.

40:44.110 --> 40:46.110
Alright, alright.

40:46.110 --> 40:47.230
Nan Heng.

40:50.110 --> 40:51.320
Nan Heng.

40:53.440 --> 40:54.730
Heng.

40:55.460 --> 40:57.260
Darling Heng.

40:58.070 --> 40:59.860
Don't be angry, okay?

41:00.230 --> 41:02.230
He can throw a tantrum like
it's on another level.

41:02.230 --> 41:04.070
No way I'd like that kind of person.

41:04.070 --> 41:05.110
I promise you.

41:05.110 --> 41:05.920
I swear.

41:06.150 --> 41:07.630
If I like Nan Feng,

41:07.630 --> 41:09.320
may I be struck by lightning.

41:22.070 --> 41:23.270
Don't talk nonsense.

41:24.510 --> 41:26.480
Anyway, I don't care about your past.

41:26.480 --> 41:27.360
From now on,

41:27.880 --> 41:28.960
I'm the only one

41:29.000 --> 41:30.710
who can perform scenes with you.

41:30.710 --> 41:31.640
You promised me,

41:32.840 --> 41:34.000
white head,

41:34.800 --> 41:36.150
same heart.

41:38.590 --> 41:39.590
You're quite something.

41:39.590 --> 41:40.960
Your English is quite fluent now.

41:40.960 --> 41:42.000
Of course.

41:42.400 --> 41:44.660
I also remember what you wrote last time.

41:45.070 --> 41:46.670
"Li leaps like a carp;

41:47.480 --> 41:48.890
Heng sweeps through
domestic entertainment."

41:48.890 --> 41:49.410
Right?

41:54.330 --> 41:55.730
Let me ask you.

41:55.960 --> 41:57.110
Do you know

41:57.130 --> 42:00.460
what "Heng sweeps through
domestic entertainment" means?

42:01.270 --> 42:02.610
Of course I do.

42:03.400 --> 42:04.510
It's

42:04.710 --> 42:06.560
a type of delicious fish.

42:07.070 --> 42:07.730
Right?

42:07.880 --> 42:09.110
Delicious fish?

42:11.880 --> 42:12.630
I am

42:12.630 --> 42:14.400
that delicious fish.

42:21.420 --> 42:28.140
♪ Look at the sky, flowers bloom
and fragrance fills the air ♪

42:28.810 --> 42:32.760
[Grace and Harmony]

42:29.530 --> 42:36.160
♪ The sound of heartbeats
resonates in the passing time ♪

42:37.220 --> 42:43.990
♪ Look at the way you're going,
destiny has it all planned out ♪

42:45.330 --> 42:56.750
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

42:55.100 --> 43:00.390
[A Dream Within A Dream]

43:08.320 --> 43:09.120
Please enjoy.

43:10.030 --> 43:12.150
[The End]

43:15.360 --> 43:19.260
[Director Guo Hu]

43:19.840 --> 43:20.830
Over here.

43:21.000 --> 43:21.710
This way.

43:21.710 --> 43:22.670
Ms. Zhuang Liu.

43:22.670 --> 43:24.280
Have you finished the script?

43:24.280 --> 43:25.420
What happens to

43:25.450 --> 43:27.050
the screenwriter, Bixiong, in the end?

43:27.050 --> 43:27.730
He

43:27.760 --> 43:29.070
is just a minor supporting role,

43:29.070 --> 43:30.280
a fictional character.

43:30.280 --> 43:32.080
I wrote him back to modern times.

43:39.270 --> 43:41.830
[The End]

43:43.360 --> 43:44.280
Nan Heng.

43:44.630 --> 43:46.280
What if
the fictional characters' awakening

43:44.940 --> 43:47.490
[A Dream Within A Dream]

43:46.440 --> 43:48.570
and us successfully changing our fate

43:48.590 --> 43:50.360
are also part of the script?

43:50.670 --> 43:51.620
For example,

43:51.800 --> 43:54.070
what if this script is not
"Dream of Qingning",

43:54.070 --> 43:55.480
but "A Dream Within A Dream?"

43:55.480 --> 43:56.750
What should we do then?

43:57.360 --> 43:59.050
Then let's keep changing our fate,

43:59.050 --> 44:04.290
[Grace and Harmony]

43:59.760 --> 44:01.380
until the moment we die.

46:51.190 --> 46:52.330
Song Xiaoyu!

46:52.480 --> 46:53.790
Are you crazy?

46:53.840 --> 46:56.100
You're late on the first day of fittings!

47:09.360 --> 47:10.820
Could it be that all of this

47:11.940 --> 47:13.370
is just a dream?

47:16.690 --> 47:21.980
[A Dream of Qingning]

47:27.610 --> 47:29.340
I'll put it here. Please enjoy.

47:37.850 --> 47:39.890
Right? I think it's okay.

47:42.870 --> 47:44.350
I think

47:46.290 --> 47:47.820
the schedule is a bit tight.

47:51.010 --> 47:52.480
Why don't you just go to the heaven
and leave us for good?

47:52.480 --> 47:53.500
The whole crew has been waiting
just for you!

47:53.500 --> 47:54.650
I'm talking to you.

47:54.840 --> 47:55.430
Later,

47:55.460 --> 47:56.920
go talk to the director...

47:57.080 --> 47:58.230
Song Xiaoyu!

48:00.190 --> 48:00.760
Director.

48:00.760 --> 48:01.590
Xiaoyu!

48:01.790 --> 48:02.850
Look at the camera.

48:03.670 --> 48:04.230
Director.

48:04.230 --> 48:05.480
Hurry up and put on makeup.

48:05.480 --> 48:07.210
Okay. I'm sorry.

48:24.030 --> 48:25.090
What are you doing?

48:38.670 --> 48:39.400
Nothing.

48:46.150 --> 48:47.880
-What's that about?
-Exactly.

48:57.230 --> 48:58.160
Song Yimeng.

49:03.110 --> 49:04.510
What did you just call me?

49:06.030 --> 49:07.070
Song Yimeng.

49:10.160 --> 49:12.190
Is that a character's name?

49:16.030 --> 49:17.180
White head.

49:17.670 --> 49:19.320
Same heart.

49:20.120 --> 49:22.360
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

49:23.300 --> 49:25.730
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

49:26.710 --> 49:29.920
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

49:30.930 --> 49:32.110
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

49:33.360 --> 49:36.390
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

49:37.760 --> 49:41.720
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

49:42.770 --> 49:45.830
♪ To give you a love
etched into the bones ♪

49:46.920 --> 49:49.390
♪ Then it's not something to
grieve over ♪
